            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Tears of a Dragon</h2><br>We all have inner demons that sometimes tell us to do the wrong thing.<br>Savage Dragoon is in a constant battle to conquer the darkness lurking within himself...Also known as his &quot;Dark Passenger&quot;.<br><br>Where his story ends...You Decide...<br><br>This game is based on a true story, that being my own and my constant battle against depression. Meet the people who have been a large influence in my life as well as members of my family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple story endings for replayability<br></li><li>Your choices in the story affect the route you take<br></li><li>10 playable characters/party members<br></li><li>Free to save your game at any time! <br></li><li>More than 50 special powers and spells<br></li><li>30 unique enemies<br></li><li>More than 50 items between potions, weapons, shirts, and armour <br></li><li>Challenging dungeons to explore<br></li><li>Provide for your family by taking on mercenary work<br></li><li>Meet Savage Dragoon's Dark Passenger. Will he take control?</li></ul>",
